@extends('pages.info-layout') @section('title','About MarketPG') @section('heading','About MarketPG') @section('content')<p>MarketPG is a Papua New Guinea marketplace built to make it easier for people and businesses to discover, buy and sell goods locally.</p><h2>Our purpose</h2><p>We bring local buyers and sellers together in one place, helping useful products find new homes and supporting commerce across PNG's provinces and towns.</p><h2>How it works</h2><ol><li>Browse products and open a listing to view its photos, description, price and seller details.</li><li>Sign in to your MarketPG account to continue with a purchase or contact a seller.</li><li>Review seller information and follow the payment and delivery instructions shown for your order.</li><li>Confirm delivery only after you have received your item.</li></ol><h2>Shop thoughtfully</h2><p>Read descriptions carefully, ask sellers for any details you need, and keep payment records and order references safe. MarketPG may review listings and transactions to help protect the community.</p>@endsection